       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.   TINITPLN.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.

      *****************************************************************
      *REMARKS.   ****THIS PROGRAM INITIATES A PLANNED WORK ORDER;
      *               SUBROUTINES CALLED:
      *                   TADDWOII
      *                   TNEWWONU
      *****************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **                   MODIFICATION   HISTORY
      *****************************************************************
      *C 06/03/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 6193
      *C    1. ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK FOR SAFETY EQUIPMENT FLAG
      *C       IN CHECK EDITS PARAGRAPH.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
